          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Инструменты EDID — только экспорт"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EDR headroom describes macOS’s current output. It doesn’t confirm that HDR reaches the display, and it doesn’t turn on hardware HDR." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
